/*
 * $DOC$
 * $NAME$
 * GTI_MOUSEPOS_XY
 *
 * $ONELINER$
 * Return the mouse position in pixels
 *
 * $SYNTAX$
 * GtInfo( GTI_MOUSEPOS_XY ) --> aPosition
 *
 * $ARGUMENTS$
 * `GTI_MOUSEPOS_XY` The selector, from gtinfo.ch.
 *
 * $RETURNS$
 * The last mouse position as { nX, nY }, in the pixels of the window.
 *
 * $DESCRIPTION$
 * MRow() and MCol() give the same position in text cells.
 *
 * $NOTES$
 * Supported by GTWVT, GTSDL3, GTXWC and GTGLFW. On other terminals the result is NIL.
 *
 * $EXAMPLES$
 *
 * $OUTPUT$
 *
 * $CATEGORY$
 * Functions GT
 *
 * $HEADER$
 * gtinfo.ch
 *
 * $SEEALSO$
 * GTI_MOUSESTATUS, MRow(), MCol()
 *
 * $DOCEND$
 */
